        "body": "# Avalanche or snowball\nFour debts, the minimums, and an extra $200 a month. The **Payoff Planner** pays every minimum and throws the extra at the head debt; as each one clears, its minimum joins the pile.\n\n**Avalanche** (highest APR first) pays the least interest. **Snowball** (smallest balance first) clears the store card in a couple of months. Same money, different order; compare the two summaries.",
